sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Person
  participant C as Mobile or web
  participant P as Privy
  participant API as API
  participant DB as Postgres

  alt first time
    U->>C: email
    C->>P: send code, loginWithCode
  else returning
    C->>P: login passkey (relying party business.expendi.app)
  end
  P-->>C: access token
  C->>API: GET /me (Bearer token)
  API->>P: verify token (JWKS or local key)
  opt first login
    API->>P: fetch email
    API->>DB: create or link users row, activate pending invites, audit
  end
  API-->>C: user + memberships
  opt after an email sign-in
    C->>P: offer to link a login passkey
  end
  alt no full name
    C->>API: PATCH /me
  end
  alt no company
    C->>API: POST /organizations (sign-up, wallet setup starts)
  else several companies
    C->>C: pick one (stored per user)
  end
  C->>API: /organizations/:id/* with the chosen company
